/obj/item/paper/krg_hb_ag
	name = "Krosian Royal-Grade:tm: Hair Brush Appraisal Guide"
	info = {"<center><b>KROSIAN ROYAL-GRADE:tm: HAIR BRUSH</b><br><b>APPRAISAL FIELD GUIDE</b></center><hr>
	<b>BASE VALUE:</b> 40 credits. Apply each modifier below.
	<BR><b>COUNTERFEIT:</b> subtract 40 credits if the pad is fake silk, the handle is plaster, the screws are not brass, or the bristle count is 18, 22, or 56.
	<BR><b>BRISTLES:</b> add 150 credits for 50 bristles, 100 for 38, or 60 for 22. These bonuses stack with all other modifiers.
	<BR><b>HANDLE MATERIAL:</b> add 120 credits for render bone, 40 for buffalo bone, or 10 for bovine bone.
	<BR><b>BRISTLE DAMAGE:</b> subtract 2 credits per broken or missing bristle.
	<BR><b>PAD DAMAGE:</b> subtract 20 credits for a broken pad.
	<BR><b>SCREWS:</b> subtract 5 credits if rusted, stripped, or grimy.
	<BR><b>HANDLE CONDITION:</b> subtract 40 credits if the bone is yellowed or the handle is visibly damaged. Apply this deduction only once if both apply.
	<BR><b>VALUE FLOOR:</b> final appraised value cannot be less than 45 credits.
	<BR><hr><b>EXPORT PAYOUT</b>
	<BR>If your estimate is below 65% or above 125% of the true value, payout is the 45-credit minimum.
	<BR>Otherwise, payout is your estimate, rounded to a whole credit. An exact appraisal adds a 113-credit accuracy bonus."}

/obj/item/paper/tttk_ag
	name = "Tact-Tract-Travel Kit Appraisal Guide"
	info = {"<center><b>TACT-TRACT-TRAVEL KIT</b><br><b>APPRAISAL FIELD GUIDE</b></center><hr>
	<b>BASE VALUE:</b> 120 credits; use 80 credits instead if counterfeit. Apply all applicable modifiers.
	<BR><b>COMPLETE CONTENTS:</b> add 150 credits when both eye drops and comb are present.
	<BR><b>SHAMPOO:</b> add 200 credits for NELLY Corp. 5-in-1.
	<BR><b>MIRROR:</b> add 120 credits for a silver frame.
	<BR><b>VALUE REDUCTION:</b> subtract 20 credits if the frame is not silver and the shampoo is not ShaBubble, Bubble-Buddy, or Sapple's Sam Shampoo.
	<BR><b>DAMAGE:</b> subtract 10 credits for each damaged towel, soap, razor set, shampoo packet, or toothbrush. A cracked or dirty mirror counts as one damaged product total, even if both apply.
	<BR><b>VALUE FLOOR:</b> final appraised value cannot be less than 60 credits.
	<BR><hr><b>COUNTERFEIT CHECK</b>
	<BR>The kit is counterfeit if any condition below applies:
	<BR>- Has only one of the following item without the other; eye drops, comb.
	<BR>- Has any damaged product.
	<BR>- Shampoo is not ShaBubble, Bubble-Buddy, Sapple's Sam Shampoo, or NELLY Corp. 5-in-1.
	<BR>- Factory line is outside 1-12.
	<BR>- Soap is not blue, white, green, or teal, or does not weigh 15g.
	<BR>- Toothbrush is not a toothbrush; towel is not white or is not 3, 4, or 6 inches.
	<BR>- Mirror frame is not silver, copper, or iron, or mirror is not 3, 4, or 6 inches.
	<BR><hr><b>EXPORT PAYOUT</b>
	<BR>If your estimate is below 65% or above 125% of the true value, payout is the 60-credit minimum.
	<BR>Otherwise, payout is your estimate, rounded to a whole credit. An exact appraisal adds a 150-credit accuracy bonus."}

/obj/item/paper/music_box_ag
	name = "Occult Clockwork Music Box Appraisal Guide"
	info = {"<center><b>OCCULT CLOCKWORK MUSIC BOX</b><br><b>APPRAISAL FIELD GUIDE</b></center><hr>
	<b>BASE VALUE:</b> 100 credits for a genuine box, or 50 credits if counterfeit.
	<BR><b>COUNTERFEIT CHECK:</b> The box is counterfeit if the maker's mark is not DOLL Makers or its gears are not brass.
	<BR><b>GEARS:</b> add 70 credits for brass gears.
	<BR><b>RARE TUNE:</b> add 120 credits for 'The 1st Hand'. Other tunes do not change the value.
	<BR><b>CASE:</b> add 90 credits for rosewood or 40 for walnut. Lacquered tin adds no value.
	<BR><b>WEAR:</b> subtract 30 credits for worn gears, 35 for a damaged case, and 30 if the winding key is missing.
	<BR><b>VALUE FLOOR:</b> final appraised value cannot be less than 50 credits.
	<BR><hr><b>EXPORT PAYOUT</b>
	<BR>If your estimate is below 65% or above 125% of the true value, payout is the 50-credit minimum.
	<BR>Otherwise, payout is your estimate, rounded to a whole credit. An exact appraisal adds a 125-credit accuracy bonus."}